    The positions visited by the fly form a cycle.
    For n cups, we need to check if this cycle covers all positions.
    """
    if n == 1:
        return True
        
    # For n cups, at minute k, the fly jumps k positions
    # The position after k minutes will be: (1 + 2 + ... + k) % n
    # If n is odd, it won't visit all positions
    # If n is even, it definitely won't visit all positions
    # This is because the sum of the sequence will always be even after a point
    
    return False

